(5589989, 809571, 104220, '<td valign="top">I am torn between yours, and the other similar image, but as these are, so far, the only two that have moved me, both receive high scores from me.<br/> <br/>All I''d say, is perhaps you should have waited a bit longer to take the shot so as to let the sock mark disappear on the right leg, but even so, the mark does kind of add some reality to it as there is no best or planned time to do the inevitable..!!</td>', 'I am torn between yours, and the other similar image, but as these are, so far, the only two that have moved me, both receive high scores from me. All I''d say, is perhaps you should have waited a bit longer to take the shot so as to let the sock mark disappear on the right leg, but even so, the mark does kind of add some reality to it as there is no best or planned time to do the inevitable..!!', '2009-07-29 06:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
