(5590006, 809237, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the bird at the bottom of the frame, and I like the idea of the tall crop. However, I find the four spots very distracting--the pattern and dark tone really draws your eye. It''s an excellent image without the spots, and I''m afraid that you''re going to get hit for it...</td>', 'I like the bird at the bottom of the frame, and I like the idea of the tall crop. However, I find the four spots very distracting--the pattern and dark tone really draws your eye. It''s an excellent image without the spots, and I''m afraid that you''re going to get hit for it...', '2009-07-29 06:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590009, 809521, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and well done. The white in the lower right is pretty distracting, however. Maybe an angle a little more to the right might have put the pinkish brown item directly behind the cross and move the white out of the frame?</td>', 'Very nice image and well done. The white in the lower right is pretty distracting, however. Maybe an angle a little more to the right might have put the pinkish brown item directly behind the cross and move the white out of the frame?', '2009-07-29 06:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
