(5590250, 808905, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the detail. Concept is great. Good luck!<br/> <br/>Dad: Bella, what do you think?<br/>Bella: It''s a beetle bug.<br/>Dad:What''s it doing?<br/>Bella: Laying on it''s back.<br/>Dad:Why?<br/>Bella: To get inside the leaf.<br/>Dad:Why?<br/>Bella: There is no more room on the leaf and it wants to dump out the seeds!<br/>Dad: Oh...<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'I like the detail. Concept is great. Good luck! Dad: Bella, what do you think?Bella: It''s a beetle bug.Dad:What''s it doing?Bella: Laying on it''s back.Dad:Why?Bella: To get inside the leaf.Dad:Why?Bella: There is no more room on the leaf and it wants to dump out the seeds!Dad: Oh... :)', '2009-07-29 11:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
