(5599565, 810008, 30982, '<td valign="top">We see so many birds in a day''s time, yet we rarely see them deceased.  I often wonder why that is?  Where do they go to die?  Yet when we do see them, they always seem to have their feet neatly curled.  Good of you to bury this one.</td>', 'We see so many birds in a day''s time, yet we rarely see them deceased.  I often wonder why that is?  Where do they go to die?  Yet when we do see them, they always seem to have their feet neatly curled.  Good of you to bury this one.', '2009-08-05 04:29:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5599582, 810204, 92577, '<td valign="top">Have you compared your picture with MAK''s (second place) and wondered why his did better? They are both similar subjects with similar processing using similar equipment. I gave them both the same score. Put them side by side and yours looks a little softer and flatter. I''m no expert but here''s my suggestion: After you''ve reduced the image size to DPC spec. apply Smart Sharpen which has the added effect of boosting contrast as well as sharpening. (If you already knew this kindly disregard the above) .</td>', 'Have you compared your picture with MAK''s (second place) and wondered why his did better? They are both similar subjects with similar processing using similar equipment. I gave them both the same score. Put them side by side and yours looks a little softer and flatter. I''m no expert but here''s my suggestion: After you''ve reduced the image size to DPC spec. apply Smart Sharpen which has the added effect of boosting contrast as well as sharpening. (If you already knew this kindly disregard the above) .', '2009-08-05 04:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5599658, 810184, 67152, '<td valign="top">A big congrats on this one - it''s a great shot.</td>', 'A big congrats on this one - it''s a great shot.', '2009-08-05 07:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
