(5600203, 810211, 53147, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club - <br/> <br/>I wish I had yoru description available when voting on this image. It didnt grab me during vote - I was one of your 5s. I like how the sparks reflect off the teeth - but the concept in general didnt connect with me.<br/> <br/>However - after reading your description I found a new appreciation for the image - a better understanding of what you were shooting for. It completes out the image much better for me now. <br/> <br/>I know this doesnt affect your score nor does it offer any photographical commentary (not sur eif photographical is a word). But I am glad I pulled this image from the queue. I dont go back often enough to look at image safter challenge.<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club -  I wish I had yoru description available when voting on this image. It didnt grab me during vote - I was one of your 5s. I like how the sparks reflect off the teeth - but the concept in general didnt connect with me. However - after reading your description I found a new appreciation for the image - a better understanding of what you were shooting for. It completes out the image much better for me now.  I know this doesnt affect your score nor does it offer any photographical commentary (not sur eif photographical is a word). But I am glad I pulled this image from the queue. I dont go back often enough to look at image safter challenge. Tim', '2009-08-05 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5600266, 809939, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>:  Good looking bunch of preserved flowers that have retained their colour well. Fits the challenge well.<br/> <br/><b>Composition</b> The flowers are well placed in the frame, although I personally agree with Jutilda that the ribbon is maybe unnecessary.  I know the black ribbon helps put the flowers into context, but I think the flowers could stand on their own.<br/> <br/>I like the muted tones, the colours do work well for this image.<br/> <br/>Overall I think this was a rather low score and in my opinion it was worth more than 5.37.  So I am sorry for that.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club First Impression:  Good looking bunch of preserved flowers that have retained their colour well. Fits the challenge well. Composition The flowers are well placed in the frame, although I personally agree with Jutilda that the ribbon is maybe unnecessary.  I know the black ribbon helps put the flowers into context, but I think the flowers could stand on their own. I like the muted tones, the colours do work well for this image. Overall I think this was a rather low score and in my opinion it was worth more than 5.37.  So I am sorry for that.', '2009-08-05 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
