(5600667, 809924, 40024, '<td valign="top">Good detail.<br/> <br/>Could have been worse you could have been photographing only half a bee like the bee named Eric in the famous Monty Python tune.<br/> <br/>"Half a bee, philosophically, must ipso facto half not be. But half the bee has got to be, vis-à-vis its entity - d''you see? But can a bee be said to be or not to be an entire bee when half the bee is not a bee, due to some ancient injury?".</td>', 'Good detail. Could have been worse you could have been photographing only half a bee like the bee named Eric in the famous Monty Python tune. "Half a bee, philosophically, must ipso facto half not be. But half the bee has got to be, vis-à-vis its entity - d''you see? But can a bee be said to be or not to be an entire bee when half the bee is not a bee, due to some ancient injury?".', '2009-08-05 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
